# __GAME__

What the game is in one paragraph: the genre, how many play, what a match or a run is, and what it shows of unified.
`uni run __GAME__` plays it.

## Controls

Each action and its keys and buttons.

## How it plays

The rules in the order `tick` runs them, one line each, naming each tuning constant rather than its value: what a
player's input moves, what each command (`Cmd_*`) does, what the world does on its own, how a run ends.

## Scripted players

What the scripted players do in headless runs and tests (`script.odin`).

## Views

What each view and MultiView shows, which events (`Event_*`) it plays, and the session data (`Data_*`) the HUD reads.
